@startuml view-cnc-client-server
!include plantuml-theme.puml
left to right direction
title Runtime — client-server components and connectors (UML component diagram)
actor "Demo user" as user
actor "API developer" as dev
component "Web UI\n(React 19 SPA,\nruns in the browser)" as spa
component "Static web server\n(nginx-unprivileged 1.31)" as web
component "News API process\n(Spring Boot 4, Java 27)" as apiproc {
  component "News API\n(Spring MVC,\nspringdoc)" as api
  component "Schema migrator\n(Flyway, at startup)" as flyway
}
database "News database\n(PostgreSQL 16)" as db
interface "REST /api/news\n(JSON over HTTP)" as rest
interface "OpenAPI /v3/api-docs\nand Swagger UI" as docs
interface "JDBC / SQL" as jdbc
user --> spa : uses in a browser
spa --> web : downloads index.html\nand the JS bundle (HTTP)
api -up- rest
api -up- docs
spa ..> rest : calls (cross-origin, CORS)
dev ..> docs : reads and tries out
db - jdbc
api ..> jdbc : reads and writes news_items
flyway ..> jdbc : applies V1 schema
@enduml
